DPHDP3  03.01.04  ze dne 11. 8. 2026

Structure version and digest of the bundled dphdp3_epo2.xsd, pinned by hand.

WHY: `verzePis` is a bare xs:string with no fixed value, and the XSD carries
no version stamp of its own, so a stale copy and a stale `verzePis` literal
both validate perfectly. Only this file makes a refresh visible. (The CZ
authority overwrites one unversioned file in place, unlike the SK one,
which keeps an XSD per vzor.)

REFRESH PROCEDURE
  1. Fetch  https://adisspr.mfcr.cz/adis/jepo/schema/dphdp3_epo2.xsd
     (plain curl). Test presence by STATUS CODE: a miss is 200 with zero
     bytes, never a 404.
  2. Compare against data/dphdp3_epo2.xsd byte for byte.
  3. Read Verze / Ze dne from
     https://adisspr.mfcr.cz/dpr/adis/idpr_pub/epo2_info/popis_struktury_detail.faces?zkratka=DPHDP3
  4. If either moved: replace the XSD, update the digest and size on the
     first line, the version line above, and the `verzePis` literal in
     report/dphdp3_report.xml — three places, kept in step by the tests.
  5. There is no changelog; diff the two XSDs to see what changed.

